        "question_en": "What are activity tags? Are they visible to guardians?",
        "answer_ja": "配信後に写真を検索する時に活動タグで絞り込むことができる先生向けの便利な機能です。配信前の写真チェック画面または配信後の写真管理画面で設定できます。",
        "answer_en": "This is a handy feature for teachers that lets you filter by activity tags when searching photos after distribution. You can set it on the Photo Check screen before distribution or on the Photo Management screen after distribution."
    },
    {
        "category_id": 1,
        "category_ja": "使い方について",
        "category_en": "About usage",
        "sub_category_id": 3,
        "sub_category_ja": "配信",
        "sub_category_en": "Delivering Picture",
        "question_ja": "配信後の写真に記録される日付は撮影日ですか？配信を行った日ですか？",
        "question_en": "Is the date recorded on distributed photos the shooting date or the distribution date?",
        "answer_ja": "施設管理・保護者アプリどちらの画面でも共通で、配信を行った日で表示されます。",
        "answer_en": "Both the facility management and guardian app screens display the distribution date."
    },
    {
        "category_id": 1,
        "category_ja": "使い方について",
        "category_en": "About usage",
        "sub_category_id": 3,
        "sub_category_ja": "配信",
        "sub_category_en": "Delivering Picture",
        "question_ja": "配信枚数に制限はありますか？",
        "question_en": "Is there a limit to the number of photos I can distribute?",
        "answer_ja": "上限の制限はございませんが、サービス価値を感じていただくためにも、お一人あたり月30枚以上を目安に配信いただけますと幸いです。",
        "answer_en": "There is no upper limit, but to help guardians feel the service value, we recommend distributing at least about 30 photos per child per month."
    },
    {
        "category_id": 1,
        "category_ja": "使い方について",
        "category_en": "About usage",
        "sub_category_id": 4,
        "sub_category_ja": "写真管理",
        "sub_category_en": "Picture Management",
        "question_ja": "配信した写真を施設がダウンロードすることはできますか？",
        "question_en": "Can the facility download distributed photos?",
        "answer_ja": "はい、できます。費用は枚数無制限で無料です。<br />写真管理から対象の写真を開き、「ダウンロード」ボタンをクリックしてください。<br />また、写真検索結果画面の右上「選択」をクリックして写真を複数枚選択することで、一括ダウンロードも可能です。",
        "answer_en": "Yes. It is free with no limit on the number of photos.<br />Open the target photo in Photo Management and click the \"Download\" button.<br />You can also bulk download by clicking \"Select\" in the upper right of the photo search results and selecting multiple photos."
    },
    {
        "category_id": 1,
        "category_ja": "使い方について",
        "category_en": "About usage",
        "sub_category_id": 4,
        "sub_category_ja": "写真管理",
